  ('02811b7a-d755-5140-add7-a6bec24d6e77', 'GA', 'city', 'Atlanta, GA', 'Submit A Code Violation (APD Code Enforcement Section)', 'https://www.atlantapd.org/i-want-to/submit-a-code-violation', 'City of Atlanta, Atlanta Police Department Code Enforcement Section', 'local_government', 'code_enforcement', array['repairs_habitability']::text[], 'tenant', 'html', 'City page explaining how to report Atlanta Housing Code and other code violations to the APD Code Enforcement Section through ATL311 (phone, email, or online at atl311.com) or in person.', null, null, 'unverifiable', 'HTTP 403 from an Akamai bot wall for WebFetch and curl. The whole site 403s, including the home page, robots.txt and a made-up path, so the 403 proves nothing about whether this page exists. Existence NOT confirmed: the session''s WebSearch budget was used up, and the ATL311 home page (atl311.com) does not link to it. Also unverified whether Atlanta Code Enforcement still sits under APD. Check by hand in a browser before shipping.', '2026-10-19T00:00:00Z', '{"notes":"The live site returned HTTP 403 (Akamai) to every automated request. The content was confirmed from an Internet Archive capture dated 2026-08-25: 311 at 404-546-0311 (Mon-Fri 7am-6pm), ATL311@atlantaga.gov or codesrequests@atlantaga.gov, 818 Pollard Blvd SW, 3rd Floor."}'::jsonb),
