  ('9015d902-af1f-566d-b6b0-8a0481799946', 'NM', 'state', null, 'NMSA 1978 Chapter 47 (Property Law): Article 8, Uniform Owner-Resident Relations Act, and Article 8A, Rent Control Prohibition', 'https://nmonesource.com/nmos/nmsa/en/item/4408/index.do', 'New Mexico Compilation Commission (NMOneSource.com)', 'state_agency', 'statute', array['general','repairs_habitability','rent_increase','rent_control','late_fees','security_deposit','entry_privacy','eviction','retaliation','lease_termination','domestic_violence','utilities']::text[], 'both', 'html', 'The official annotated text of NMSA Chapter 47. Article 8 (§§ 47-8-1 to 47-8-52) is the Uniform Owner-Resident Relations Act, which covers rent and late fees, deposits, owner and resident obligations, entry, abatement, retaliation, termination notices and possession actions. Article 8A (§ 47-8A-1) bars local rent control ordinances.', 'NMSA 1978 §§ 47-8-1 to 47-8-52; § 47-8A-1', null, 'verified', null, '2026-10-19T00:00:00Z', '{"notes":"Chapter-level deep link; the full chapter loads as a PDF (https://nmonesource.com/nmos/nmsa/en/4408/1/document.do). Article 8 begins at § 47-8-1, and § 47-8A-1 follows § 47-8-52. Article 10 (Mobile Home Park Act) is in the same chapter. The site footer showed ''Website last modified: 10/19/2026''. Plain WebFetch returns 403; the page opened with a browser user agent."}'::jsonb),
