  ('5f0d920c-cf3c-5e7e-aadc-b49dcb518bbd', 'WY', 'state', null, 'Wyoming Fair Housing Act (W.S. Title 40, Chapter 26)', 'https://wyoleg.gov/statutes/compress/title40.pdf', 'Wyoming State Legislature', 'state_legislature', 'statute', array['fair_housing','accessibility']::text[], 'both', 'pdf', 'Official compiled text of Wyoming Statutes Title 40, which includes Chapter 26, the Wyoming Fair Housing Act, covering prohibited practices in the sale and rental of dwellings, exemptions, and the complaint process.', 'Wyo. Stat. 40-26-101 to 40-26-145', null, 'checked', null, '2026-10-19T00:00:00Z', '{"notes":"Confirmed in the extracted text: ''CHAPTER 26 - FAIR HOUSING ACT'', 40-26-101 (short title) through the complaint sections at 40-26-115 to 40-26-135. Under 40-26-102(a)(viii), the ''enforcing authority'' is a state agency or Wyoming nonprofit that HUD has accepted. The legislature publishes only the whole title as one PDF, so there is no section-level deep link; Chapter 26 sits deep inside it."}'::jsonb)
